<title>POLAND: POLISH NBP OFFERS PLN 500 MLN 91-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH NBP OFFERS PLN 500 MLN 91-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland</p>
<p>offered 500 million zlotys of 91-day NBP-bills on Friday, the</p>
<p>central bank said.</p>
<p>    Deadline hour		 - 12:00</p>
<p>    Date of settlement	  - June 27, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity of bills offered - September 26, 1997</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
